OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday morning will be cloudy
OL,6,Fwith the odd spot of rain. Skies will
OL,7,Fbrighten from the northwest in the
OL,8,Fafternoon leaving a mostly fine
OL,9,Fevening. Fresher, in gentle
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear and dry night to
OL,13,Fcome, with perhaps an isolated shower
OL,14,Fin the far southwest of Cornwall.
OL,15,FFeeling cool for many with some very
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
