OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA dry and bright morning to
OL,6,Fstart Friday with some patchy cloud in
OL,7,Fthe north. Sunshine turning a little
OL,8,Fhazier into the afternoon, but feeling
OL,9,Fwarm in the sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday looks dry with some warm
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine, in gentle winds. A
OL,14,Fchance of some much needed rain
OL,15,Fdeveloping across the region later on
OL,16,FSunday and on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
